Third-party code redistributed in this repository
--------------------------------------------------------------------------------

None.

Every tracked file at the current tip is original work of Metacraft Labs. The
Move packages under test-programs/ and examples/ vendor no upstream sources and
declare no dependencies of their own; the Move standard library and the Sui
framework are supplied by the Move toolchain at build time and are not committed
here.

For reference, the upstream projects this recorder targets are:

    Sui / Move standard library   https://github.com/MystenLabs/sui
    Move language                 https://github.com/move-language/move

