standard library and Sui framework — 1092 files, of which 182 were sources
carrying upstream copyright headers:

    Copyright (c) Mysten Labs, Inc.
    Copyright (c) The Move Contributors
    Copyright (c) The Diem Core Contributors

all marked SPDX-License-Identifier: Apache-2.0 and redistributed unmodified.
That tree was removed from every branch on 2026-09-16; it is not present in any
